The rebuttal period is now coming to an end, and we would like to sincerely thank all reviewers for their time and constructive comments. We have been fully committed to carefully analyzing and addressing each point. 

In particular, we incorporated the following reviewers' comments:

- new prediction models (KNF, N-BEATS);

- new real-world dataset (ETTh);

- additional evaluation based on Lyapunov exponents;

- a GMM-based variant of our framework. 

Although we may not have fully engaged all reviewers during the rebuttal and received limited follow-up feedback, we sincerely hope that our efforts and the new results presented will be taken into account when reassessing the paper and its final scores.
